                                "sense_id": "769d7e0d-613e-3005-937d-a6806a34d641",
                                "text": "The tenure of Church lands was in \"frankalmoigne,\" or \"free alms.\" Tenants in frankalmoigne had only to perform the \"three necessities\"—to keep up highways, build castles, and repel invasions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
